      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Obufu bw'aba Yuda buhandikisize ekalamu y'ekyoma, ey'akalimi k'ealumasi. Obufu obwo buhandikirwe aha mitima yabo n'aha mahembe ga altare zabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Yuda abo nibafukamira ebishushani bya Ashera, ruhanga omukazi; kandi Ashera ogwo nibamutambira ebitambo aha altare ezombekire ahali buli kigabiro, n'aha nshozi eiguru ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'aha mabanga omw'ishwa. Omu nsi yanyu yona eitunga lyanyu n'ebyanyu byona ndabinaga omu mikono y'ababisha babinyage nimbatura amafu ganyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi eyo nabahaire muraginagaho, nshube mbahindure bairu b'ababisha banyu omu nsi eyo mutalikumanya, kuba nyina ekiniga ekilikwaka nk'omuliro, mara kilikara kityo ebiro byona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omutima gw'omuntu guba gugobya kushaga ebintu byona, kandi guba gubi muno. Ayakugushobokerwa n'ohai? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye Omukama, n'inye manya ebitekelezo by'abantu n'emitima yabo. Buli omoi mukolera kuhonderana n'emirolereye, n'ebyo akora.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu atungira omu bugobya ashusha endahi eyatira amahuli ago etanagiire. Eitunga lilimuhwaho akyali muto ashube ahanyuma abe mufera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwensinga yaitu neshusha enketo ey'ekitinwa, kwema obutwe ekombekwa aha ibanga eiguru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Mukama, iwe shubi ya Isiraeli, abakushenga bona balishonara. Abakushenga iwe balihwaho nk'amabara agahandikire omw'itaka, waitu Mukama nchuro y'amaizi g'oburora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Mukama bankize, nkire; bandokore, ndokoke; kuba nyebuga iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu nibambaza bati, “Ebyo Omukama abaire natutinisa nabyo mbwenu bilihai? Tibiba!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai inye, waitu Mukama, tinkakuhembeleraga k'obateza naku. Kandi tinkagonzaga k'ogira kiro ekyo wababoneshezaho biyengo. Waitu Mukama eki nokimanya; n'ebyo ngambire nobimanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osingire, otankanga. Omu naku obuhungiro bwange aba iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abangingiza bashonare, kyonkai inye ntashonara. Babumbulikwe, kyonkai inye ntabumbulikwa. Gira ekiro ekyo wababoneshezaho enaku, obasilikize kimoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akangambira ati, “Yeremia, ogende oyemelere aha Kihigi ky'Oruganda rw'Ababenjamini, ekyo Abakama ba Yuda batahiramu bakashoholeramu, n'omu bihigi byona bya Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obagambiire oti, ‘Inywe bakama ba Yuda, inywena abantu ba Yuda n'aba Yerusalemu inywena, abatahira omu bihigi ebi, muhulire.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, ‘Kamuraba nimwenda oburora, mwelinde. Mutashutura migugu anga kugitahya Yerusalemu aha kiro kya Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya Sabato mutagira migugu yomwaihya mu maju ganyu handiki kukora mulimo gwona gwona. Mwekomye okwo ekiro kya Sabato kili kitakatifu, nk'okwo naragiire bashwenkurw'inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai tibantegire matwi, tibampuliire. Bakagumangana emitima, ebyo nabahabwire tibabihuliire.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Inywe kamurampulira, mutatahize mugugu mu kigo aha kiro kya Sabato, mukekomya okwo ekiro kya Sabato kiba kitakatifu, mutakozire milimo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho ekigo eki kya Yerusalemu kilitahwamu abakama abashuntamire aha nketo ya Daudi, nibabuga amagali, bakuubire efarasi, bonene n'abatwazi babo, abantu ba Yuda n'aba Yerusalemu. Kandi ebiro byona ekigo eki kiraturwagamu abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bararugaga omu bigo bya Yuda n'ebyaro ebyataine Yerusalemu, baruge n'omu nsi ya Benjamini, baruge na Shefela, n'omu mabanga, na Negebu, balete ebihongo by'okwokibwa n'ebitambo ebihango by'emyaka n'obunuma n'ebihongo by'esiimi, babilete omuli Rwensinga y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai kamutampuliire, kuta nimushemeza ekiro kya Sabato, mukalekera kutahya emigugu omuli Yerusalemu aha kiro ekyo, aho Yerusalemu ndagyokya n'ebikaare byamwo, kandi taliho araguraza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
